## D-019: Retry / Exponential Backoff

**Max retries**: 5
**Base delay**: 30 seconds
**Backoff multiplier**: 2× per attempt
{{ if eq .DeadLetterMechanism "rabbitmq" }}**Dead-letter**: After max retries exceeded, route to RabbitMQ DLQ (`{{ .ExchangeName }}.dlq`)
{{ else }}**Dead-letter**: After max retries exceeded, set `{{ .RetryEntity }}.status = 'dead_lettered'` in PostgreSQL — **no RabbitMQ, no message queue**. "DLQ" here means a database status field only.
{{ end }}**Attempt tracking**: `attempt` int field on `{{ .RetryEntity }}` entity
